This app is the matching mobile phone app of Honda genuine accessories dashcam.

This app must be used in conjunction with the Honda DVR dashcam to operate the dashcam:

Control start / stop recording, taking photos, setting parameters, viewing video playback, pictures, etc. the detailed functions are as follows:

1. Real-time monitoring: it can view the image display of the current dashcam in real time, control its recording and photographing;

2. Video playback: display the video files in the device in the form of a list, click to play the video files, or delete or download them to the mobile phone;

3. Local download: display the pictures taken in the form of file list, click to view the pictures, and delete the files to release the storage space of mobile phone;

4. Settings: it can adjust the white balance, exposure, HDMI output resolution and other parameters of the dashcam, display the current hardware and app version number, and also adjust the relevant settings of the hot spots of the dashcam.
